\plain\plain\f0\fs22\ql\plain\f0\fs22\plain\f1\fs22 Writer calls Midwest Open MRI in regards to patient wanting to pursue brain MRI at their clinic. Writer is told by Midwest scheduler that the MRI order should be faxed along with the patient's demographic 
